  "pier": {
    "_note": "The full deck recipe per PierStyle — `PIER_STYLES` in c2d/structures.js. Not just a colour: which seams, which rails, whether it carries lamps or a hut, and whether it lies on the ground. This is the family whose gap shipped for a week — the builder emitted four `malecon` piers, the renderer had no recipe, and the lookup fell through to `concrete`, drawing four beach ramps as grey quays with blue railings and lamps on the sand.",
