  "median": {
    "_note": "LA MEDIANA del Paseo — the planted strip down the middle of the avenue, with the palms on it. It is GREEN GROUND and it is a WALL: the build stamps it CLS_ACERA (`stamp_paseo_median`), wider than it is drawn, so the car stops at the visible green instead of slipping into a drawn-but-unstamped round cap and getting trapped there. Drawn by `paintMergedMedian`/the singles pass in c2d/streets.js; the minimap drew the same green from a fourth copy.",
